{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Habit Tracker 是一款節奏平靜的每日習慣追蹤工具，適合想建立規律生活、維持專注並看清自己進度的人。它把打卡、連續紀錄、健康數據與專注時間集中在同一個介面，減少在不同 App 之間切換的麻煩。原價 US $2.99 的終生版現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，內購限時免費期間可一次收下完整功能。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-166.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>習慣追蹤結合健康數據</h2>\n<p>用戶可為任何想建立或戒除的習慣打卡，支援勾選、計數、時長與自訂數值，並按星期、類別與時段規劃流程。App 以連續紀錄、熱力圖與完成率呈現進度，亦可連結 Apple Health 自動同步步數、睡眠與飲水數據。連續紀錄護盾與度假模式會在忙碌或外遊時守住成果，內建專注計時器記錄深度工作時間。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-186-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-187-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-188-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-189-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-190-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-191-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Habit Tracker: Planner Routine 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Habit Tracker: Planner Routine</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/habit-tracker-planner-routine/id6774956996\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T20:24:39.356767+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":492,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T19:56:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:35.733699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T20:17:55.561819+00:00","content_hash":"ca038e4c1ef6b03ca08e32f4c2adecebeeefd3c0fb90f21de4c1bd20f1cd3afe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}